 ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌


Hi, 

Maddie here from Originality.AI! 

Originality.AI is very excited to introduce our Multilanguage Release
version 1.0. This model supports 15 languages in total which we believe
is a step towards a more inclusive platform. The decision for this
release was made to address some of the existing gaps that has stood
between diverse languages and accurate AI Detection Technology.

In our latest blog post, we dive into the details of this release in
terms of our development, testing, and future plans. Here are the
highlights:

* Our first version of the multilingual AI detector has surpassed

****90% accuracy**** across all languages!

* Accuracy is around 95% and false positive is approximately 4.5%

* We are just starting- future work will include expanding our dataset
as well as exploring different deep learning structures for improved
outcomes. 

****The 15 languages that are available for AI Detection at
Originality.AI are: ****

* English 

* Spanish

* Turkish

* Italian

* French

* Russian

* German

* Portuguese 

* Dutch

* Chinese ( Mandarin) 

* Greek

* Polish 

* Vietnamese

* Japanese 

* Persian

